      System(SYS_POSFIN_API, "Point-of-Sale Finance Service", "Domain API for point-of-sale finance: dealer applications, shopper identity and consent, decisions, and the payment schedule that follows. Built with GKE · Point-of-Sale Finance Cache.", $tags="systems")
